<title>ITALY: Italian M2 grew avge 4.4 pct in qtr end-Aug.</title>
<headline>Italian M2 grew avge 4.4 pct in qtr end-Aug.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian money supply as measured by M2 grew an adjusted average 4.4 percent year-on-year in the three months to end-August compared with an average growth of 4.2 percent in the three months to end-July, the Bank of Italy said in a statement.</p>
</text>
